"\n<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M9.5 14.5l5-5M8 10l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 5 5L13 15M16 14l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0-5-5L11 9\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Lektion</div><div class=\"lk-big\">37</div><h1>고급 연결어와 2격 전치사</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Weitere Konnektoren und Präpositionen mit Genitiv</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">19·20·27·28과에서 접속사·접속부사·zu 부정형으로 문장을 잇는 법을 배웠어요.<br>B2의 글과 뉴스에는 더 정확한 연결 표현이 자주 나와요 — 대조의 wohingegen, 이유를 덧붙이는 zumal, 상황에 따라 달라지는 je nachdem.<br>같은 내용을 전치사구로 짧게 말하는 2격 전치사도 많이 쓰여요 — <strong>Aufgrund</strong> des Streiks fallen Züge aus.<br>이 과에서는 이런 표현을 뜻별로 정리하고, 접속사 문장을 전치사구로 바꾸는 연습을 해요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 과에서 익힐 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">대조를 während · wohingegen · dagegen · hingegen · im Gegensatz zu로 말해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">이유와 결과를 zumal · folglich · infolgedessen으로 더해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">조건과 범위를 je nachdem · vorausgesetzt, dass · insofern … als로 말해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">zu … als dass · außer dass · nur dass · abgesehen davon, dass를 써요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">2격 전치사를 뜻별로 쓰고, 3격을 쓰는 gemäß · entsprechend · zufolge를 구별해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">접속사 문장을 전치사구로 바꿔요 — weil es regnete → wegen des Regens</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">복습</span><span class=\"sub-title\">16·19·20·28과 복습</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> ____ des Regens sind wir zu Hause geblieben. <span class=\"qh\">비 때문에</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Wegen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Statt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Während</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Trotz</button></div><div class=\"qe\">이유 → wegen + 2격 (16과).</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Es regnet. ____ gehen wir spazieren. <span class=\"qh\">그래도</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Deshalb</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Denn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Trotzdem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Obwohl</button></div><div class=\"qe\">접속부사 → 도치 (19과).</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Man lernt eine Sprache, ____ man viel spricht. <span class=\"qh\">말을 많이 함으로써</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) obwohl</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) sodass</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) damit</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) indem</button></div><div class=\"qe\">방법 → indem (20과).</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Er ging weg, ____ sich zu verabschieden. <span class=\"qh\">인사도 없이</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) um</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) ohne</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) anstatt dass</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) statt</button></div><div class=\"qe\">ohne … zu (28과).</div></div></div>\n<section id=\"sec-A\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">A</span><h2>한국어로 먼저 보기</h2></div><p>한국어는 '비 때문에'와 '비가 와서'처럼 같은 내용을 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">명사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">명사</span>사람·동물·물건·장소·생각의 이름이 되는 말이에요. 독일어 명사는 첫 글자를 대문자로 써요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: der Tisch 책상 · die Liebe 사랑</span></span></span>로도, 문장으로도 말해요.<br>독일어도 마찬가지예요. 이유는 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">접속사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">접속사</span>단어나 문장을 이어 주는 말이에요. 종류에 따라 어순이 달라져요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: und · aber · weil · dass</span></span></span>(weil), <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">접속부사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">접속부사</span>앞 문장과 뜻을 이어 주는 부사예요. 첫 자리에 오면 바로 뒤에 동사가 와요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: deshalb · trotzdem · dann</span></span></span>(deshalb), <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">전치사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">전치사</span>명사·대명사 앞에 붙어 장소·시간·이유 같은 관계를 나타내는 말이에요. 뒤에 올 격을 정해요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: mit dem Bus · für dich</span></span></span>(wegen·aufgrund)로 말할 수 있어요.</p><div class=\"dgm\"><div class=\"dgm-cap\">같은 내용, 세 가지 모양</div><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th></th><th>이유</th><th>양보</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>접속사 — 동사 끝</td><td><strong>Weil</strong> es stark <strong>regnete</strong>, blieben wir zu Hause.</td><td><strong>Obwohl</strong> es stark <strong>regnete</strong>, gingen wir spazieren.</td></tr><tr><td>접속부사 — 도치</td><td>Es regnete stark. <strong>Deshalb blieben</strong> wir zu Hause.</td><td>Es regnete stark. <strong>Trotzdem gingen</strong> wir spazieren.</td></tr><tr><td>전치사 — 명사 하나</td><td><strong>Aufgrund des</strong> starken <strong>Regens</strong> blieben wir zu Hause.</td><td><strong>Trotz des</strong> starken <strong>Regens</strong> gingen wir spazieren.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"dgm-note\">전치사구는 짧고 딱딱해서 글·뉴스·공문에서 많이 써요. 말할 때는 접속사 문장이 더 자연스러워요.</div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-B\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">B</span><h2>대조 — 한쪽은 이렇고 다른 쪽은 저래요</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">'한쪽은 이렇고 다른 쪽은 저렇다'는 während·wohingegen(<span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">동사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">동사</span>동작이나 상태를 나타내는 말이에요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: lernen 배우다 · sein ~이다</span></span></span>가 끝)이나 dagegen(<span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">첫 자리<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">첫 자리</span>평서문에서 동사 바로 앞의 자리예요. 주어나 시간·장소 같은 말 하나가 이 자리에 와요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Heute lerne ich Deutsch. — Heute가 첫 자리</span></span></span>면 바로 뒤에 동사)으로 말해요.</p></div></div><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left t-first\"><thead><tr><th>표현</th><th>종류</th><th>예</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>während</strong></td><td>종속접속사 — 동사 끝</td><td>Mein Bruder liebt Sport, <strong>während</strong> ich lieber <strong>lese</strong>.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>wohingegen</strong></td><td>종속접속사 — 동사 끝, 글말</td><td>Im Norden regnet es oft, <strong>wohingegen</strong> es im Süden trocken <strong>ist</strong>.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>dagegen · hingegen</strong></td><td>접속부사 — 첫 자리면 도치, 주어 뒤에도 와요</td><td>Er liebt Sport. <strong>Dagegen lese</strong> ich lieber. · Ich <strong>hingegen</strong> lese lieber.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>im Gegensatz zu</strong> + 3격</td><td>전치사</td><td><strong>Im Gegensatz zu</strong> meinem Bruder lese ich lieber.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">시간의 während, 대조의 während</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">27과의 während는 '~⁠하는 동안'이었어요. 두 사람·두 지역처럼 서로 다른 것을 나란히 놓으면 '~⁠인 반면'이 돼요.</p></div></div><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">대조</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Meine Schwester ist sehr ordentlich, ____ ich eher chaotisch bin.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) dagegen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) wohingegen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) zumal</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) deshalb</button></div><div class=\"qe\">동사 끝 → 종속접속사 wohingegen.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Die Stadt ist laut. Das Dorf ____ ist ruhig.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) dagegen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) während</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) wohingegen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) obwohl</button></div><div class=\"qe\">주어 뒤에 놓는 접속부사 → dagegen.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> ____ seinem Vater spricht er sehr gut Englisch. <span class=\"qh\">아버지와 달리</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Während</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Dagegen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Im Gegensatz zu</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Wohingegen</button></div><div class=\"qe\">명사 앞 → im Gegensatz zu + 3격.</div></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-C\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">C</span><h2>이유와 결과를 더하기</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">zumal은 '게다가 ~⁠하니까', folglich는 '그러므로'예요 — Ich bleibe zu Hause, <strong>zumal</strong> es regnet.</p></div></div><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left t-first\"><thead><tr><th>표현</th><th>종류</th><th>뜻</th><th>예</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>zumal</strong></td><td>종속접속사 — 동사 끝</td><td>게다가 ~⁠하니까 (이유를 덧붙임)</td><td>Ich gehe heute nicht aus, <strong>zumal</strong> ich morgen früh arbeiten <strong>muss</strong>.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>folglich</strong></td><td>접속부사 — 도치</td><td>그러므로</td><td>Die Straße war gesperrt. <strong>Folglich mussten</strong> wir einen Umweg fahren.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>infolgedessen</strong></td><td>접속부사 — 도치, 글말</td><td>그 결과</td><td>Es gab einen Unfall. <strong>Infolgedessen kam</strong> es zu langen Staus.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">19과와 함께</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">deshalb · deswegen · daher · darum(그래서)과 nämlich(왜냐하면 — <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">첫 자리<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">첫 자리</span>평서문에서 동사 바로 앞의 자리예요. 주어나 시간·장소 같은 말 하나가 이 자리에 와요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Heute lerne ich Deutsch. — Heute가 첫 자리</span></span></span>에 오지 않음)는 19과에서 배웠어요. folglich · infolgedessen은 더 격식 있는 말이에요.</p></div></div><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">이유와 결과</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Ich kaufe das Auto nicht, ____ es auch noch sehr teuer ist. <span class=\"qh\">게다가 아주 비싸기까지 하니까</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) trotzdem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) folglich</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) dagegen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) zumal</button></div><div class=\"qe\">이유를 덧붙임 + 동사 끝 → zumal.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Der Flug wurde gestrichen. ____ mussten wir im Hotel übernachten.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Obwohl</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Folglich</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Wohingegen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Zumal</button></div><div class=\"qe\">결과 + 도치 → folglich.</div></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-D\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">D</span><h2>조건과 범위</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">je nachdem은 '~⁠에 따라 달라요', vorausgesetzt, dass는 '~⁠라는 조건이라면'이에요.</p></div></div><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left t-first\"><thead><tr><th>표현</th><th>뜻</th><th>예</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>je nachdem</strong>, ob · wie · wann …</td><td>~⁠에 따라 (달라요)</td><td>Wir fahren mit dem Rad oder mit dem Bus, <strong>je nachdem, wie</strong> das Wetter <strong>ist</strong>.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>vorausgesetzt, (dass)</strong></td><td>~⁠라는 조건이라면</td><td>Wir wandern morgen, <strong>vorausgesetzt, dass</strong> es nicht <strong>regnet</strong>.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>insofern</strong> …, <strong>als</strong></td><td>~⁠라는 점에서</td><td>Das Treffen war <strong>insofern</strong> nützlich, <strong>als</strong> wir alle Fragen klären <strong>konnten</strong>.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>für den Fall, dass</strong></td><td>~⁠할 경우에 대비해</td><td><strong>Für den Fall, dass</strong> es <strong>regnet</strong>, nehmen wir einen Schirm mit.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">짧게 대답할 때</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">Kommst du am Wochenende mit? — <strong>Je nachdem.</strong> 상황 봐서.<br>je nachdem 하나로 '경우에 따라 달라요'라는 대답이 돼요.</p></div></div><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">조건과 범위</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Ich komme mit dem Auto oder zu Fuß, ____, wie viel Zeit ich habe.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) zumal</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) vorausgesetzt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) je nachdem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) insofern</button></div><div class=\"qe\">~⁠에 따라 → je nachdem.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Du kannst das Auto haben, ____, dass du vorsichtig fährst. <span class=\"qh\">조심히 운전한다는 조건이라면</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) je nachdem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) vorausgesetzt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) insofern</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) abgesehen davon</button></div><div class=\"qe\">조건 → vorausgesetzt, dass.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Der Kurs war ____ gut, als ich viele Leute kennengelernt habe.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) sofern</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) infolge</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) zumal</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) insofern</button></div><div class=\"qe\">insofern …, als.</div></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-E\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">E</span><h2>일어나지 않는 결과 · 예외</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">zu …, als dass는 '너무 ~⁠해서 못 한다', nur dass는 '~⁠만 빼면'이에요.</p></div></div><h3>zu …, als dass — 너무 ~⁠해서 ~⁠할 수 없다</h3><p>25과의 zu + <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">형용사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">형용사</span>사람이나 사물이 어떤지를 나타내는 말이에요. 명사 앞에서는 어미가 붙어요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Das Buch ist gut. · das gute Buch</span></span></span> 뒤에 als dass 문장을 이어요. als dass 문장에는 보통 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">접속법<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">접속법</span>사실이 아닌 일, 바람, 정중함, 남의 말을 나타내는 동사 형태예요(Konjunktiv).<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Ich hätte gern … · Er sagt, er sei krank.</span></span></span> II를 써요.</p><div class=\"exl\"><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Das Wasser ist <strong>zu</strong> kalt, <strong>als dass</strong> man darin schwimmen <strong>könnte</strong>.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">물이 너무 차가워서 수영할 수 없어요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Die Aufgabe ist <strong>zu</strong> schwer, <strong>als dass</strong> ich sie allein lösen <strong>könnte</strong>.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">과제가 너무 어려워서 혼자 풀 수 없어요.</span></div></div><h3>außer dass · nur dass · abgesehen davon, dass — ~⁠만 빼면</h3><div class=\"exl\"><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Der Urlaub war toll, <strong>außer dass</strong> es oft geregnet <strong>hat</strong>.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">비가 자주 온 것만 빼면 휴가는 최고였어요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Die Wohnung ist schön, <strong>nur dass</strong> sie etwas klein <strong>ist</strong>.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">집은 좋아요, 좀 작다는 것만 빼면요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Abgesehen davon, dass</strong> es teuer <strong>war</strong>, war das Essen sehr gut.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">비쌌던 것만 빼면 음식은 아주 좋았어요.</span></div></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">28과와 함께</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">ohne dass · ohne … zu(~⁠하지 않고), (an)statt dass · statt … zu(~⁠하는 대신)는 28과에서 배웠어요.</p></div></div><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">zu … als dass · 예외</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Der Text ist zu lang, ____ ich ihn heute lesen könnte.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) sodass</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) damit</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) außer dass</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) als dass</button></div><div class=\"qe\">zu …, als dass.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Das Konzert war super, ____ es etwas zu laut war. <span class=\"qh\">좀 시끄러웠던 것만 빼면</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) nur dass</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) sodass</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) zumal</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) als dass</button></div><div class=\"qe\">~⁠만 빼면 → nur dass.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> ____ davon, dass es regnete, war der Ausflug schön.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Außer</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Vorausgesetzt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Abgesehen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Ohne</button></div><div class=\"qe\">abgesehen davon, dass.</div></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-F\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">F</span><h2>2격 전치사 — 뜻별로</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">글에서는 aufgrund(~ 때문에)·dank(~ 덕분에)·bezüglich(~⁠에 관해) 같은 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">2격<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">2격</span>'~의'를 나타내는 자리예요. 다른 명사 뒤에서 누구·무엇의 것인지 나타내요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: das Auto des Mannes 그 남자의 차</span></span></span> <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">전치사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">전치사</span>명사·대명사 앞에 붙어 장소·시간·이유 같은 관계를 나타내는 말이에요. 뒤에 올 격을 정해요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: mit dem Bus · für dich</span></span></span>를 많이 써요.</p></div></div><p>16과의 wegen · trotz · während · statt · innerhalb · außerhalb에 더해, 글에서 자주 보는 2격 전치사를 뜻별로 정리해요.</p><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left t-first\"><thead><tr><th>뜻</th><th>전치사</th><th>격</th><th>예</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>원인</td><td><strong>aufgrund</strong> ~ 때문에 · <strong>infolge</strong> ~⁠의 결과로 · <strong>angesichts</strong> ~⁠을 고려하면</td><td>2격</td><td><strong>Aufgrund</strong> des Streiks fallen viele Züge aus.</td></tr><tr><td>덕분</td><td><strong>dank</strong> ~ 덕분에</td><td>2격 · 말할 때 3격</td><td><strong>Dank</strong> deiner Hilfe habe ich es geschafft.</td></tr><tr><td>관련</td><td><strong>bezüglich · hinsichtlich</strong> ~⁠에 관해</td><td>2격</td><td><strong>Bezüglich</strong> Ihrer Anfrage …</td></tr><tr><td>수단</td><td><strong>mithilfe</strong> ~⁠의 도움으로 · <strong>mittels</strong> ~⁠을 써서 · <strong>anhand</strong> ~⁠을 바탕으로</td><td>2격</td><td><strong>Anhand</strong> eines Beispiels erkläre ich das.</td></tr><tr><td>목적</td><td><strong>zwecks</strong> ~⁠을 위해</td><td>2격 (관사 없이 자주)</td><td><strong>zwecks</strong> besserer Zusammenarbeit</td></tr><tr><td>계기</td><td><strong>anlässlich</strong> ~⁠을 맞아</td><td>2격</td><td><strong>Anlässlich</strong> seines Geburtstags gab es ein Fest.</td></tr><tr><td>대신</td><td><strong>anstelle</strong> ~ 대신에</td><td>2격</td><td><strong>Anstelle</strong> des Chefs kam seine Assistentin.</td></tr><tr><td>장소</td><td><strong>oberhalb · unterhalb</strong> 위쪽·아래쪽 · <strong>jenseits</strong> 저편</td><td>2격</td><td><strong>oberhalb</strong> des Dorfes</td></tr><tr><td>출처</td><td><strong>laut</strong> ~⁠에 따르면</td><td>2격·3격 · 관사 없이 자주</td><td><strong>Laut</strong> Polizei gab es keine Verletzten.</td></tr><tr><td>출처·기준</td><td><strong>gemäß · entsprechend</strong> ~⁠에 따라 · <strong>zufolge</strong> ~⁠에 따르면</td><td><strong>3격</strong></td><td><strong>gemäß</strong> dem Vertrag · dem Bericht <strong>zufolge</strong></td></tr><tr><td>길</td><td><strong>entlang</strong> ~⁠을 따라</td><td>앞에 오면 2격, 뒤에 오면 4격</td><td><strong>entlang</strong> des Flusses · den Fluss <strong>entlang</strong></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"callout callout-warn\"><span class=\"co-badge co-warn\">gemäß · entsprechend · zufolge는 3격</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">격식 있는 말이라 2격으로 착각하기 쉬워요 — ✓ gemäß <strong>dem</strong> Vertrag (✕ gemäß des Vertrags).<br>zufolge는 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">명사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">명사</span>사람·동물·물건·장소·생각의 이름이 되는 말이에요. 독일어 명사는 첫 글자를 대문자로 써요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: der Tisch 책상 · die Liebe 사랑</span></span></span> 뒤에 와요 — dem Bericht <strong>zufolge</strong>.</p></div></div><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">2격 전치사</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> ____ des schlechten Wetters wurde das Spiel abgesagt. <span class=\"qh\">나쁜 날씨 때문에</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Anhand</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Anstelle</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Aufgrund</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Trotz</button></div><div class=\"qe\">원인 → aufgrund.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> ____ seiner Hilfe habe ich die Wohnung schnell gefunden. <span class=\"qh\">그의 도움 덕분에</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Dank</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Infolge</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Laut</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Trotz</button></div><div class=\"qe\">좋은 원인 → dank.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> ____ Ihrer Bestellung möchten wir Ihnen mitteilen, … <span class=\"qh\">주문에 관해</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Bezüglich</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Oberhalb</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Aufgrund</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Mittels</button></div><div class=\"qe\">관련 → bezüglich.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Gemäß ____ Vertrag müssen Sie drei Monate vorher kündigen.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) der</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) den</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) des</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) dem</button></div><div class=\"qe\">gemäß + 3격.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> Wir sind ____ spazieren gegangen. <span class=\"qh\">강을 따라</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) dem Fluss entlang des</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) den Fluss entlang</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) entlang den Fluss</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) den Fluss entlangs</button></div><div class=\"qe\">뒤에 오는 entlang → 4격.</div></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-G\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">G</span><h2>접속사 문장을 전치사구로</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">문장 하나를 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">전치사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">전치사</span>명사·대명사 앞에 붙어 장소·시간·이유 같은 관계를 나타내는 말이에요. 뒤에 올 격을 정해요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: mit dem Bus · für dich</span></span></span> + <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">명사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">명사</span>사람·동물·물건·장소·생각의 이름이 되는 말이에요. 독일어 명사는 첫 글자를 대문자로 써요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: der Tisch 책상 · die Liebe 사랑</span></span></span>로 줄여 짧게 쓸 수 있어요 — weil es regnete → <strong>wegen des Regens</strong> 비 때문에.</p></div></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" alt=\"Wegen des starken Regens fällt das Spiel aus. 비가 많이 와서 경기가 취소돼요.\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><div><span class=\"ph-de\"><strong>Wegen des</strong> starken <strong>Regens</strong> fällt das Spiel aus.</span><span class=\"ph-ko\">비가 많이 와서 경기가 취소돼요.</span></div></figcaption></figure><p>문장 하나를 전치사 + 명사로 줄이면 글이 짧고 격식 있어져요. <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">동사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">동사</span>동작이나 상태를 나타내는 말이에요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: lernen 배우다 · sein ~이다</span></span></span>를 명사로 바꾸는 법은 38과에서 더 자세히 배워요.</p><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left t-first\"><thead><tr><th>접속사 문장</th><th>전치사구</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Weil</strong> es stark <strong>regnete</strong>, …</td><td><strong>Wegen · Aufgrund</strong> des starken Regens …</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Obwohl</strong> er krank <strong>war</strong>, …</td><td><strong>Trotz</strong> seiner Krankheit …</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Wenn</strong> es <strong>regnet</strong>, …</td><td><strong>Bei</strong> Regen …</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Nachdem</strong> er <strong>angekommen war</strong>, …</td><td><strong>Nach</strong> seiner Ankunft …</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Bevor</strong> das Spiel <strong>beginnt</strong>, …</td><td><strong>Vor</strong> Beginn des Spiels …</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Während</strong> er <strong>studierte</strong>, …</td><td><strong>Während</strong> seines Studiums …</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Indem</strong> man viel <strong>liest</strong>, …</td><td><strong>Durch</strong> viel Lesen …</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Um</strong> die Umwelt <strong>zu schützen</strong>, …</td><td><strong>Zum Schutz</strong> der Umwelt …</td></tr></tbody></table></div><figure class=\"fig\"><div class=\"fig-scroll\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 290\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"접속사 문장을 전치사구로 — 접속사는 전치사로, 부사는 형용사로, 동사는 명사로 바뀌어요\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><defs><marker id=\"clause_to_phrase-ink\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mki\"/></marker><marker id=\"clause_to_phrase-acc\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mka\"/></marker><marker id=\"clause_to_phrase-ok\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mko\"/></marker><marker id=\"clause_to_phrase-no\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mkn\"/></marker><marker id=\"clause_to_phrase-w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mkw\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"148.3\" y=\"29.0\" width=\"65.1\" height=\"42.0\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-boxo\"/><text x=\"180.9\" y=\"56.8\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-okt\" font-weight=\"700\">Weil</text><rect x=\"221.4\" y=\"29.0\" width=\"44.6\" height=\"42.0\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-box\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 5\"/><text x=\"243.7\" y=\"56.8\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-t\" font-weight=\"700\">es</text><rect x=\"274.0\" y=\"29.0\" width=\"70.3\" height=\"42.0\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-boxw\"/><text x=\"309.2\" y=\"56.8\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-wt\" font-weight=\"700\">stark</text><rect x=\"352.3\" y=\"29.0\" width=\"99.3\" height=\"42.0\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-boxa\"/><text x=\"402.0\" y=\"56.8\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-a\" font-weight=\"700\">regnete,</text><rect x=\"125.4\" y=\"151.0\" width=\"84.4\" height=\"42.0\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-boxo\"/><text x=\"167.6\" y=\"178.8\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-okt\" font-weight=\"700\">Wegen</text><rect x=\"217.8\" y=\"151.0\" width=\"55.8\" height=\"42.0\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-box\"/><text x=\"245.7\" y=\"178.8\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-t\" font-weight=\"700\">des</text><rect x=\"281.6\" y=\"151.0\" width=\"92.9\" height=\"42.0\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-boxw\"/><text x=\"328.1\" y=\"178.8\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-wt\" font-weight=\"700\">starken</text><rect x=\"382.5\" y=\"151.0\" width=\"92.1\" height=\"42.0\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-boxa\"/><text x=\"428.6\" y=\"178.8\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-a\" font-weight=\"700\">Regens</text><line x1=\"180.9\" y1=\"72.0\" x2=\"167.6\" y2=\"148.0\" class=\"f-lo\" marker-end=\"url(#clause_to_phrase-ok)\"/><text x=\"187.2\" y=\"116.0\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-okt\" font-weight=\"700\">①</text><line x1=\"309.2\" y1=\"72.0\" x2=\"328.1\" y2=\"148.0\" class=\"f-lw\" marker-end=\"url(#clause_to_phrase-w)\"/><text x=\"331.6\" y=\"116.0\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-wt\" font-weight=\"700\">②</text><line x1=\"402.0\" y1=\"72.0\" x2=\"428.6\" y2=\"148.0\" class=\"f-la\" marker-end=\"url(#clause_to_phrase-acc)\"/><text x=\"428.3\" y=\"116.0\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-a\" font-weight=\"700\">③</text><text x=\"243.7\" y=\"92.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-m\">빠져요</text><text x=\"245.7\" y=\"212.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-m\" font-weight=\"700\">2격</text><text x=\"300.0\" y=\"248.0\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-t\"><tspan font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-okt\">①</tspan> 접속사 → 전치사 · <tspan font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-wt\">②</tspan> 부사 → 형용사 + 어미 · <tspan font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-a\">③</tspan> 동사 → 명사</text><text x=\"300.0\" y=\"274.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-m\">문장 하나가 짧은 명사구가 돼요 — 글에서 많이 써요</text></svg></div><figcaption>접속사 문장을 전치사구로 바꾸면 세 가지가 바뀌어요</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">전치사구로 바꾸기</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Obwohl es kalt war, gingen wir baden. → ____ der Kälte gingen wir baden.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Nach</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Bei</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Trotz</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Wegen</button></div><div class=\"qe\">obwohl → trotz.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Wenn es Nebel gibt, fahren Sie langsam. → ____ Nebel fahren Sie langsam.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Bei</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Trotz</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Aufgrund des</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Mit</button></div><div class=\"qe\">wenn → bei.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Nachdem der Film zu Ende war, gingen wir essen. → ____ dem Film gingen wir essen.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Während</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Seit</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Vor</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Nach</button></div><div class=\"qe\">nachdem → nach + 3격.</div></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-H\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">H</span><h2>가장 많이 하는 실수</h2></div><div class=\"trap\"><div class=\"trap-head\"><span class=\"trap-badge\">실수 1</span><span class=\"trap-label\">Fehler</span></div><div style=\"font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px\">zumal 뒤에 동사를 두 번째에 둬요</div><div class=\"trap-ex wrong\"><span style=\"color:var(--no);font-weight:700\">✕</span><span class=\"tx-b\">…, zumal ich muss morgen arbeiten.<span class=\"tx-n\">주문장 어순</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-ex right\"><span style=\"color:var(--ok);font-weight:700\">✓</span><span class=\"tx-b\">…, zumal ich morgen arbeiten muss.<span class=\"tx-n\">게다가 내일 일해야 하니까</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-note\">zumal · wohingegen · während는 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">종속접속사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">종속접속사</span>종속절을 시작하는 접속사예요. 활용된 동사가 종속절 맨 끝으로 가요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: weil · dass · wenn · obwohl</span></span></span> → <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">동사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">동사</span>동작이나 상태를 나타내는 말이에요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: lernen 배우다 · sein ~이다</span></span></span>는 맨 끝.</div></div><div class=\"trap\"><div class=\"trap-head\"><span class=\"trap-badge\">실수 2</span><span class=\"trap-label\">Fehler</span></div><div style=\"font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px\">dagegen 뒤에서 도치하지 않아요</div><div class=\"trap-ex wrong\"><span style=\"color:var(--no);font-weight:700\">✕</span><span class=\"tx-b\">Dagegen ich lese lieber.<span class=\"tx-n\">접속부사 뒤 주어</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-ex right\"><span style=\"color:var(--ok);font-weight:700\">✓</span><span class=\"tx-b\">Dagegen lese ich lieber. · Ich dagegen lese lieber.<span class=\"tx-n\">나는 반대로 책 읽는 게 더 좋아요</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-note\"><span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">첫 자리<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">첫 자리</span>평서문에서 동사 바로 앞의 자리예요. 주어나 시간·장소 같은 말 하나가 이 자리에 와요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Heute lerne ich Deutsch. — Heute가 첫 자리</span></span></span>의 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">접속부사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">접속부사</span>앞 문장과 뜻을 이어 주는 부사예요. 첫 자리에 오면 바로 뒤에 동사가 와요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: deshalb · trotzdem · dann</span></span></span> 뒤는 동사가 두 번째예요(19과).</div></div><div class=\"trap\"><div class=\"trap-head\"><span class=\"trap-badge\">실수 3</span><span class=\"trap-label\">Fehler</span></div><div style=\"font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px\">gemäß를 2격과 써요</div><div class=\"trap-ex wrong\"><span style=\"color:var(--no);font-weight:700\">✕</span><span class=\"tx-b\">gemäß des Gesetzes<span class=\"tx-n\">2격</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-ex right\"><span style=\"color:var(--ok);font-weight:700\">✓</span><span class=\"tx-b\">gemäß dem Gesetz<span class=\"tx-n\">법에 따라</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-note\">gemäß · entsprechend · zufolge는 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">3격<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">3격</span>주로 '~에게'를 나타내는 자리예요. helfen·danken 같은 동사와 mit·bei·zu 같은 전치사 뒤에도 와요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Ich gebe dem Kind ein Buch. 아이에게 책을 줘요.</span></span></span>이에요.</div></div><div class=\"trap\"><div class=\"trap-head\"><span class=\"trap-badge\">실수 4</span><span class=\"trap-label\">Fehler</span></div><div style=\"font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px\">글에서 2격 전치사 뒤에 3격을 써요</div><div class=\"trap-ex wrong\"><span style=\"color:var(--no);font-weight:700\">✕</span><span class=\"tx-b\">aufgrund dem Streik<span class=\"tx-n\">말할 때의 습관</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-ex right\"><span style=\"color:var(--ok);font-weight:700\">✓</span><span class=\"tx-b\">aufgrund des Streiks<span class=\"tx-n\">파업 때문에</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-note\">wegen · dank처럼 말할 때 3격이 들리는 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">전치사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">전치사</span>명사·대명사 앞에 붙어 장소·시간·이유 같은 관계를 나타내는 말이에요. 뒤에 올 격을 정해요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: mit dem Bus · für dich</span></span></span>도 글에서는 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">2격<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">2격</span>'~의'를 나타내는 자리예요. 다른 명사 뒤에서 누구·무엇의 것인지 나타내요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: das Auto des Mannes 그 남자의 차</span></span></span>이 기본이에요.</div></div><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">실수 피하기</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> 바른 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Ich nehme den Bus zumal, es gleich regnet.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Ich nehme den Bus, zumal regnet es gleich.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Ich nehme den Bus, zumal es regnet gleich.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Ich nehme den Bus, zumal es gleich regnet.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">zumal → 동사 끝.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> 바른 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Mein Bruder hingegen sehr ruhig ist.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Hingegen ist mein Bruder sehr ruhig.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Hingegen mein Bruder sehr ruhig ist.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Hingegen mein Bruder ist sehr ruhig.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">접속부사 첫 자리 → 도치.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> 바른 표현은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) entsprechend der Regeln</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) entsprechend den Regeln</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) entsprechend des Regels</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) entsprechend die Regeln</button></div><div class=\"qe\">entsprechend + 3격(복수 den Regeln).</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> 바른 표현은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) infolge des Unfalls</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) infolge dem Unfall</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) infolge der Unfall</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) infolge den Unfall</button></div><div class=\"qe\">infolge + 2격.</div></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-I\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">I</span><h2>참고</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">편지와 이메일에서</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">격식 있는 편지·이메일에 자주 나와요 — <strong>Bezüglich</strong> Ihrer Anfrage … · <strong>Aufgrund</strong> der hohen Nachfrage … · <strong>Anlässlich</strong> unseres Jubiläums …<br>시험의 쓰기 과제에서도 쓰기 좋은 표현이에요.</p></div></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">말할 때는 쉬운 쪽으로</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">말할 때는 aufgrund 대신 wegen, infolgedessen 대신 deshalb, wohingegen 대신 aber · während를 더 많이 써요.<br>글의 종류에 맞게 고르는 것도 B2의 능력이에요.</p></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-J\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">J</span><h2>바로 쓰는 문장 · 일상 회화</h2></div><p>말할 때도 자주 쓰는 연결 표현이에요.</p><div class=\"exl talk-l\"><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Kommst du mit? — <strong>Je nachdem.</strong></span><span class=\"talk-pr\">콤스트 두 미트 — 예 나흐뎀</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">같이 갈래? — 상황 봐서.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Dank</strong> dir hat alles geklappt!</span><span class=\"talk-pr\">당크 디어 하트 알레스 게클랍트</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">네 덕분에 다 잘 됐어!</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Abgesehen davon</strong> ist alles gut.</span><span class=\"talk-pr\">압게제엔 다폰 이스트 알레스 구트</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">그것만 빼면 다 좋아.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Ich bleibe zu Hause, <strong>zumal</strong> es regnet.</span><span class=\"talk-pr\">이히 블라이베 추 하우제 추말 에스 레그네트</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">집에 있을래, 비까지 오니까.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Laut</strong> Wetterbericht wird es morgen warm.</span><span class=\"talk-pr\">라우트 베터베리히트 비르트 에스 모르겐 바름</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">일기예보에 따르면 내일 따뜻해진대.</span></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"summary\"><div class=\"summary-card\"><h2 class=\"sum-title\">이 과 정리</h2><div><div class=\"sum-li\">대조 — während · wohingegen(동사 끝), dagegen · hingegen(접속부사), im Gegensatz zu + 3격</div><div class=\"sum-li\">이유 더하기 zumal(동사 끝), 결과 folglich · infolgedessen(도치)</div><div class=\"sum-li\">조건·범위 — je nachdem, ob/wie … · vorausgesetzt, dass · insofern …, als · für den Fall, dass</div><div class=\"sum-li\">zu …, als dass + 접속법 II(너무 ~⁠해서 못 함), außer dass · nur dass · abgesehen davon, dass(~⁠만 빼면)</div><div class=\"sum-li\">2격 전치사 — aufgrund · infolge · angesichts · dank · bezüglich · hinsichtlich · mithilfe · anhand · anlässlich · anstelle</div><div class=\"sum-li\">gemäß · entsprechend · zufolge는 3격, entlang은 뒤에 오면 4격</div><div class=\"sum-li\">접속사 문장 ↔ 전치사구 — weil → wegen · aufgrund, obwohl → trotz, wenn → bei, nachdem → nach</div></div></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\" style=\"margin-top:20px\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">다음 ⏭ 38과</span><div>38과에서는 동사와 형용사를 명사로 바꿔 글을 짧고 격식 있게 쓰는 법을 배워요 — nachdem er angekommen war → <strong>nach seiner Ankunft</strong>.</div></div></section><section id=\"solutions\" class=\"solutions\"><h2 class=\"sol-title\">Lösungen — 정답 모아보기</h2><div class=\"sol-grid\"><div><b>16·19·20·28과 복습</b>1. Wegen · 2. Trotzdem · 3. indem · 4. ohne</div><div><b>대조</b>1. wohingegen · 2. dagegen · 3. Im Gegensatz zu</div><div><b>이유와 결과</b>1. zumal · 2. Folglich</div><div><b>조건과 범위</b>1. je nachdem · 2. vorausgesetzt · 3. insofern</div><div><b>zu … als dass · 예외</b>1. als dass · 2. nur dass · 3. Abgesehen</div><div><b>2격 전치사</b>1. Aufgrund · 2. Dank · 3. Bezüglich · 4. dem · 5. den Fluss entlang</div><div><b>전치사구로 바꾸기</b>1. Trotz · 2. Bei · 3. Nach</div><div><b>실수 피하기</b>1. Ich nehme den Bus, zumal es gleich regnet. · 2. Hingegen ist mein Bruder sehr ruhig. · 3. entsprechend den Regeln · 4. infolge des Unfalls</div></div></section>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>\n"